tml">Home</a><a href="pista.html">A pista</a><a href="kart-locacao.html">Locação</a><a href="campeonatos.html">Campeonatos</a><a href="eventos.html">Eventos</a><a href="duvidas.html">Dúvidas</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://tools.mylaptime.com.br/booking?uid=5729bbc1-572b-4e32-84ec-e9e93ab08ced" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reservar agora</a></nav><main id="conteudo" tabindex="-1">
<section class="hero compact"><div class="hero-media"><video preload="metadata" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="assets/posters/home-karting.jpg" style="object-position:center 45%"><source src="assets/videos/home-karting.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="speed-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Circuito homologado</p><h1 class="page-title"><span class="outline">Pista</span><br><span class="green">1.110m</span></h1><p class="page-lead">Um traçado técnico, veloz e mutável. Cada configuração altera pontos de frenagem, linhas de tangência e estratégia.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#tracados">Ver traçados <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="kart-locacao.html">Correr nesta pista</a></div></div><div class="hero-side-number">1.110<small>metros de desafio</small></div></div></section>
<div class="telemetry-wrap"><div class="container"><div class="telemetry"><div class="telemetry-item"><div class="telemetry-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 6 6-3 6 3 6-3v15l-6 3-6-3-6 3V6Zm6-3v15m6-12v15"/></svg></div><div><strong>3 configurações</strong><span>Normal, invertido e chicane</span></div></div><div class="telemetry-item"><div class="telemetry-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7l1-8Z"/></svg></div><div><strong>Alta velocidade</strong><span>Retas e pontos técnicos</span></div></div><div class="telemetry-item"><div class="telemetry-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2M9 2h6"/></svg></div><div><strong>Cronometragem</strong><span>Precisão volta a volta</span></div></div><div class="telemetry-item"><div class="telemetry-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21V4m0 1c5-3 9 3 14 0v9c-5 3-9-3-14 0"/></svg></div><div><strong>Homologada</strong><span>Estrutura oficial de prova</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<section id="tracados" class="section"><div class="container"><div class="asym-grid"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Desenho do circuito</p><h2 class="section-title">Cada traçado muda<br><span class="accent">o jeito de pilotar</span></h2><p class="section-copy">Selecione uma configuração e veja o circuito reagir. A animação representa o fluxo de volta e a leitura de setores.</p></div><div class="metric-stack reveal"><div class="metric-mini"><h3>Maior reta</h3><strong data-count="190" data-suffix="m">190m</strong><span>Aceleração máxima e tomada de vácuo.</span></div><div class="metric-mini"><h3>Curvas técnicas</h3><strong data-count="14">14</strong><span>Combinações de baixa, média e alta.</span></div></div></div><div style="margin-top:55px"><div class="track-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Configurações da pista"><button type="button" class="track-tab active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="track-panel" data-track="normal">Normal</button><button type="button" class="track-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="track-panel" data-track="invertido">Invertido</button><button type="button" class="track-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="track-panel" data-track="chicane">Chicane</button></div><div class="track-stage reveal" id="track-panel" role="tabpanel"><svg viewBox="0 0 1080 680" role="img" aria-labelledby="track-map-title"><title id="track-map-title">Mapa estilizado do circuito</title><path id="track-path" class="track-path" d="M110 360 C160 110 370 80 480 210 C590 350 760 100 880 170 C1010 245 930 470 760 460 C600 450 560 600 380 540 C230 490 40 560 110 360"/><path id="track-green" class="track-path green" d="M110 360 C160 110 370 80 480 210 C590 350 760 100 880 170 C1010 245 930 470 760 460 C600 450 560 600 380 540 C230 490 40 560 110 360"/></svg></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg2)"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Telemetria editorial</p><h2 class="section-title">Leia a pista<br><span class="accent">antes da largada</span></h2><div class="metric-board" style="margin-top:54px"><div class="metric-main reveal"><h3>Velocidade estimada</h3><div class="metric-value"><span>até</span> 85<span>km/h</span></div><div class="metric-graph"><i style="height:22%"></i><i style="height:38%"></i><i style="height:52%"></i><i style="height:68%"></i><i style="height:84%"></i><i style="height:60%"></i><i style="height:74%"></i><i style="height:92%"></i><i style="height:66%"></i><i style="height:48%"></i><i style="height:78%"></i><i style="height:96%"></i><i style="height:72%"></i><i style="height:54%"></i><i style="height:88%"></i><i style="height:100%"></i><i style="height:62%"></i><i style="height:42%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i><i style="height:90%"></i></div></div><div class="metric-stack"><div class="metric-mini reveal"><h3>Setor técnico</h3><strong>S2</strong><span>Sequência